    affiliation: "Department of Computer Science & Engineering, Rajiv Gandhi University, Doimukh, India"
abstract: >-
  HinEmo-9 is a dataset of 30,436 YouTube comments annotated for nine emotions
  across three language varieties of Indian online discourse: English,
  Devanagari Hindi, and romanized Hinglish. The taxonomy includes two
  culturally grounded categories absent from existing emotion resources,
  Devotion and Nostalgia. The dataset is released in two tiers with per-record
  provenance: a 3,363-item core annotated independently by three annotators
  (Fleiss kappa 0.87), and a 27,073-item expansion carrying model-derived
  labels validated at 78.4% agreement against the core.
keywords:
